{
  "blocks" : [
    {
      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178372\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178372\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>The special inspections for existing subsurface conditions, fill placement, load-bearing requirements, subsurface investigations, borings and test pits shall be performed in accordance with this section and <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178371', hash: '#JD_BCTable1705.6' }}\">Table 1705.6<\/Link> of this code. The approved geotechnical report and construction documents, as applicable, shall be used to determine compliance. Special inspection reports of borings and\/or test pits shall be in accordance with ASTM D 1586, ASTM D 1587 and Section 1803.5 of this code.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178373\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178373\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable1705.6\" id=\"JD_BCTable1705.6\" title=\"BC Table 1705.6\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 1705.6<br><\/br>Required Special Inspections of Subsurface Conditions<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-178374\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-178374\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<div class=\"xsl-table\">",
      "id" : "17566-html-1",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "The special inspections for existing subsurface conditions, fill placement, load-bearing requirements, subsurface investigations, borings and test pits shall be performed in accordance with this section and Table 1705.6 of this code. The approved geotechnical report and construction documents, as applicable, shall be used to determine compliance. Special inspection reports of borings and\/or test pits shall be in accordance with ASTM D 1586, ASTM D 1587 and Section 1803.5 of this code.\n\n Table 1705.6\n Required Special Inspections of Subsurface Conditions"
    },
    {
      "html" : "<table cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width: 768px&#10;                ;\"><colgroup><col width=\"62.5%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><col width=\"18.75%&#10;              \"><\/col><\/colgroup><tbody><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Type<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Continuous<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Periodic<br><\/br>Special Inspection<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Special inspection of subsurface investigations, borings and test pits.<\/span> Boring and test pit operations, and alternative investigation methods, shall be subject to continuous special inspection to verify compliance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178872', hash: '#JD_BC1803' }}\">1803<\/Link>. Soil sample recovery operations for test pits shall be subject to continuous special inspection to verify compliance with Section <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-178872', hash: '#JD_BC1803' }}\">1803<\/Link>.<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Exceptions:<\/span><\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:54pt;text-indent:-54pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Cone penetrometer testing used as an alternative investigation method per Section 1803.5.2 shall be subject to periodic special inspection. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"margin-left:54pt;text-indent:-54pt;margin-top:0pt;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;2.&#160;&#160;&#160;Existing boring, test pit and alternative investigation records that have been deemed acceptable to the commissioner in accordance with Section 1803.4.2 are not subject to special inspection.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">During fill placement.<\/span> During placement and compaction of the fill material, the special inspector shall determine that the material being used and the maximum lift thickness comply with the approved geotechnical report, as specified in Section 1804.5.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t3.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Evaluation of in-place density.<\/span> The special inspector shall determine that the in-place dry density of the compacted fill complies with the approved construction documents.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><tr><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:0.022in;padding-right:0.022in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t4.&#160;&#160;&#160;<span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Subgrade inspection.<\/span> Immediately prior to placement of each and every footing, foundation, fill or other supporting materials, the special inspector shall determine that the site has been prepared and is in accordance with the approved geotechnical report.<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">&#8212;<\/div><\/div><\/td><td style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding-left:.075in;padding-right:.075in;padding-top:.022in;padding-bottom:.022in;border-top:1pt solid #000000;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;border-left:1pt solid #000000;border-right:1pt solid #000000;\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">X<\/div><\/div><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>",
      "id" : "17566-table-2",
      "kind" : "table"
    },
